// XFAIL: RT-77: a call the compiler builds by name (as_str for str methods, iter for `for x in &v`, as_slice for indexing) takes a program's trait method of that name (RT-77's family): form y03 (0.30.2)
// From the review of g302probe part 1. v0.30.1: user
// EXPECT: hello
trait AS { fn as_str(self) -> &'static str; }
impl AS for String<Gpa> { fn as_str(self) -> &'static str { "user" } }
